1
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,372
The building across

2
00:00:02,392 --> 00:00:04,691
the street has forty windows.

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,820
I know every one of them

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,990
by heart.

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,679
Four dances alone.

6
00:00:11,725 --> 00:00:13,911
Twelve talks to her cat.

7
00:00:13,931 --> 00:00:16,021
Thirty cries on Sundays.

8
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,695
I don't sleep much.

9
00:00:17,715 --> 00:00:19,085
So I watch.

10
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,688
Nobody ever looks up.

11
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,414
Window nine

12
00:00:25,434 --> 00:00:28,221
had been dark for a year.

13
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:29,869
On Tuesday,

14
00:00:29,889 --> 00:00:30,891
at eleven,

15
00:00:30,911 --> 00:00:32,304
the light came on.

16
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,826
I watched a man

17
00:00:37,846 --> 00:00:39,068
kill a woman.

18
00:00:39,088 --> 00:00:40,783
Every second of it.

19
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,415
The police found nothing.

20
00:00:43,435 --> 00:00:44,227
No body.

21
00:00:44,247 --> 00:00:45,156
No blood.

22
00:00:45,176 --> 00:00:46,337
No woman.

23
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:47,700
The apartment

24
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,326
had been empty for a year.

25
00:00:49,346 --> 00:00:50,983
They said I dreamed it.

26
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,392
On Wednesday,

27
00:00:54,412 --> 00:00:55,933
at eleven...

28
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,582
he killed her again.

29
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,546
Same second.

30
00:00:59,566 --> 00:01:00,533
Same arm.

31
00:01:00,553 --> 00:01:02,387
Same silent scream.

32
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:03,902
People don't die

33
00:01:03,922 --> 00:01:05,583
the same way twice.

34
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,230
So I did the one thing

35
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:09,145
a watcher

36
00:01:09,249 --> 00:01:10,573
never does.

37
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,526
I crossed the street.

38
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,132
There was no murder.

39
00:01:22,152 --> 00:01:23,386
Just a lamp...

40
00:01:23,406 --> 00:01:24,489
a sheet...

41
00:01:24,509 --> 00:01:26,169
and two paper dolls.

42
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,611
It was never a crime.

43
00:01:28,631 --> 00:01:30,140
It was a show.

44
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:34,081
And for the first time,

45
00:01:34,101 --> 00:01:35,590
I saw my own window

46
00:01:35,610 --> 00:01:37,328
from the other side.

47
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:38,861
Someone was standing

48
00:01:38,881 --> 00:01:39,681
in it.

49
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:41,651
He doesn't kill

50
00:01:41,671 --> 00:01:43,366
the women in the windows.

51
00:01:43,540 --> 00:01:44,922
He kills the women

52
00:01:44,968 --> 00:01:46,222
who watch.

53
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,564
I had ninety seconds.

54
00:01:48,584 --> 00:01:49,827
Maybe less.

55
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,001
He'd shown me

56
00:01:51,021 --> 00:01:52,104
how it works.

57
00:01:52,124 --> 00:01:53,137
A light.

58
00:01:53,157 --> 00:01:54,353
A sheet.

59
00:01:54,399 --> 00:01:55,331
Something for the eye

60
00:01:55,351 --> 00:01:56,524
to believe.

61
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:59,026
So I gave him a show.

62
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,453
They found forty paper

63
00:02:13,473 --> 00:02:14,800
dolls in his room.

64
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:16,503
One for every window.

65
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:17,908
One of them

66
00:02:17,928 --> 00:02:19,704
was holding binoculars.

67
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,001
I don't watch

68
00:02:23,021 --> 00:02:24,681
the windows anymore.

69
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,650
Mostly.

70
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,641
Be honest...

71
00:02:29,661 --> 00:02:30,535
would you have crossed

72
00:02:30,555 --> 00:02:31,600
the street?

